WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.600
(Yin Jisheng)

2
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:19.020
(Zheng Liyu)

3
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:41.220
"Thunderstorm"

4
00:00:44.228 --> 00:00:48.660
So he came from your kindergarten, right?

5
00:00:53.508 --> 00:00:55.420
Does he himself know about this?

6
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:56.500
know

7
00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:00.784
Because he left the kindergarten when he was 6 years old
Already had a personal will at that time

8
00:01:00.784 --> 00:01:02.692
A philanthropist who has long supported him

9
00:01:02.692 --> 00:01:06.156
Will help children be adopted into families at home and abroad

10
00:01:06.156 --> 00:01:08.540
The sponsor’s name is…

11
00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:09.568
yes

12
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.336
i know who he is

13
00:01:12.044 --> 00:01:13.484
he is my uncle

14
00:01:16.204 --> 00:01:19.904
Why did my uncle adopt Yizhao...

15
00:01:20.596 --> 00:01:25.200
It's relatively easy to adopt a child who doesn't realize he's been abandoned

16
00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.020
But when you get to that age, you're usually very averse to adoption.

17
00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:31.760
Li Yizhao was the oldest child in the orphanage at that time

18
00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:36.556
It is presumed that the last remaining child
Adopted by the sponsor

19
00:01:36.556 --> 00:01:39.020
But I heard that it’s because I don’t have the consent of my spouse.

20
00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:42.008
So there is no way to officially adopt him.

21
00:01:45.716 --> 00:01:47.092
Really

22
00:01:49.996 --> 00:01:50.944
OK

23
00:01:52.328 --> 00:01:53.944
thank you for your reply

24
00:02:11.724 --> 00:02:15.584
Zhenghan, there are things I didn’t tell you

25
00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:19.468
You should feel cheated by me

26
00:02:20.656 --> 00:02:23.828
I know everything. Damn it, I know you slept with Xu Zhengyin.

27
00:02:28.452 --> 00:02:31.768
I said I don't care anymore. Damn it, why are you still like this?

28
00:02:41.504 --> 00:02:43.324
Li Yizhao, are you really...

29
00:03:05.488 --> 00:03:08.284
Zhenghan, are you okay?

30
00:03:11.896 --> 00:03:12.872
Yeah

31
00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:19.748
It's a photo

32
00:03:22.696 --> 00:03:24.472
you have a high fever

33
00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:51.896
am i dreaming

34
00:04:02.956 --> 00:04:04.464
It seems like it's true

35
00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.992
Am I dying?

36
00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:11.940
Get up first and drink porridge, then take medicine later

37
00:04:23.228 --> 00:04:24.560
Is it a photo?

38
00:04:24.808 --> 00:04:26.960
Are you really a photo?

39
00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.800
Otherwise, are there any fake ones?

40
00:04:33.876 --> 00:04:35.620
Will fall down

41
00:04:35.872 --> 00:04:37.400
Why did you come just now?

42
00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.152
I've been waiting for you

43
00:04:42.528 --> 00:04:44.360
Let’s drink porridge first

44
00:04:58.168 --> 00:04:59.108
evil

45
00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:00.952
So unpalatable

46
00:05:03.264 --> 00:05:04.080
Not...

47
00:05:05.108 --> 00:05:08.080
No...I mean it tastes tasteless

48
00:05:08.348 --> 00:05:09.648
Because I have a stuffy nose

49
00:05:12.156 --> 00:05:14.080
Hurry up and finish eating. Go take medicine.

50
00:05:49.644 --> 00:05:51.096
I'm leaving first

51
00:05:53.464 --> 00:05:55.116
Remember to take medicine on time

52
00:05:55.572 --> 00:05:56.576
Don't

53
00:05:57.788 --> 00:06:00.040
I want to die directly from this illness

54
00:06:01.908 --> 00:06:03.988
Could you please stop talking like this?

55
00:06:04.612 --> 00:06:06.320
Let's see where you dare to go

56
00:06:13.184 --> 00:06:14.308
Don't go

57
00:06:19.868 --> 00:06:21.228
stay with me

58
00:06:28.044 --> 00:06:30.564
What if I hurt you and it hurts more?

59
00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.416
no one can hurt me

60
00:06:36.356 --> 00:06:38.140
If Xu Zhengyin finds out...

61
00:06:38.704 --> 00:06:40.088
don't worry

62
00:06:40.676 --> 00:06:42.320
Xu Zhengyin was arrested and imprisoned

63
00:06:45.268 --> 00:06:46.256
what

64
00:06:47.204 --> 00:06:48.744
Because he takes drugs

65
00:06:51.568 --> 00:06:53.440
Xu Zhenghan, are you really...

66
00:06:54.708 --> 00:06:57.304
I will get rid of those who hurt you one by one

67
00:07:00.416 --> 00:07:01.968
What else do you need me to help you get rid of?

68
00:07:04.684 --> 00:07:06.372
You should lie down and rest first.

69
00:07:07.656 --> 00:07:08.800
come here

70
00:07:11.936 --> 00:07:16.356
It's about why you came back suddenly

71
00:07:20.064 --> 00:07:21.772
Because of the relationship between repair and effectiveness

72
00:07:22.524 --> 00:07:24.456
What Zhang Xiuxiao?

73
00:07:26.736 --> 00:07:27.724
Yeah

74
00:07:28.116 --> 00:07:30.252
Do you really not know about Yizhao being threatened?

75
00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:33.372
Does it really have nothing to do with you?

76
00:07:33.372 --> 00:07:34.608
Threat?

77
00:07:35.528 --> 00:07:37.280
Not Zhenghan

78
00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:38.492
Really

79
00:07:38.492 --> 00:07:41.148
Xu Zhengyin’s foul mouth said this guy’s name

80
00:07:41.148 --> 00:07:43.304
Let's go first, okay?

81
00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.256
why do you say it

82
00:08:00.732 --> 00:08:02.188
Didn't I tell you?

83
00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:05.128
Zhenghan doesn’t know about this

84
00:08:05.128 --> 00:08:07.204
How can you be sure that he doesn't know?

85
00:08:07.648 --> 00:08:09.688
This timing is just perfect, right?

86
00:08:10.816 --> 00:08:13.464
As soon as the news came out that there was going to be a city update near that house,

87
00:08:13.464 --> 00:08:15.340
Xu Zhenghan is close to you

88
00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.824
Xu Zhengyin will threaten you

89
00:08:16.824 --> 00:08:18.032
i know

90
00:08:19.292 --> 00:08:21.632
I know that matter has nothing to do with Zhenghan

91
00:08:21.632 --> 00:08:24.384
Since you are so sure
Why do you still want to break up with Xu Zhenghan?

92
00:08:24.828 --> 00:08:27.632
And why on earth are you insisting on not selling the house?

93
00:08:30.484 --> 00:08:32.092
Because I'm a human again

94
00:08:36.504 --> 00:08:39.100
Dad and Zhenghan are no longer with me.

95
00:08:41.352 --> 00:08:43.136
If I gave up my house

96
00:08:44.828 --> 00:08:46.576
I'm really alone

97
00:08:51.108 --> 00:08:52.116
What about me?

98
00:08:55.452 --> 00:08:57.196
Am I some kind of invisible person?

99
00:09:01.168 --> 00:09:02.164
sorry

100
00:09:06.852 --> 00:09:08.168
One photo

101
00:09:09.332 --> 00:09:10.228
Yeah

102
00:09:11.924 --> 00:09:16.548
You have always lived for others

103
00:09:19.728 --> 00:09:21.460
It's time to live for yourself

104
00:09:23.352 --> 00:09:25.364
Don't worry about others

105
00:09:26.584 --> 00:09:28.128
according to your heart

106
00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:32.312
do what you want

107
00:09:33.256 --> 00:09:35.224
That's what Xu Zhenghan and I look forward to most

108
00:09:40.972 --> 00:09:42.632
what do you want to do now

109
00:09:47.192 --> 00:09:49.288
I want to stay with Junghan

110
00:09:53.812 --> 00:09:54.924
go ahead

111
00:09:59.996 --> 00:10:01.720
Go to that guy quickly

112
00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:10.076
I want to stay by your side

113
00:10:11.472 --> 00:10:12.864
Did anyone say no?

114
00:10:13.236 --> 00:10:14.852
I said I would help you get rid of them

115
00:10:17.968 --> 00:10:19.516
Your dad...

116
00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:21.920
my uncle

117
00:10:22.304 --> 00:10:26.760
Ah...I can't get rid of my dad

118
00:10:33.896 --> 00:10:37.560
And we're not blood cousins either.

119
00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:38.720
So what

120
00:10:41.712 --> 00:10:43.836
How do you know about this...

121
00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:48.312
How could you be so stupid

122
00:10:49.144 --> 00:10:53.404
He is not your biological father
You took care of him for 9 years and wasted your youth.

123
00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.032
Say sorry to Seo Jung-in who has nothing to do with you

124
00:10:56.032 --> 00:10:58.692
Listen to those weird things he said about you being an illegitimate child

125
00:10:59.732 --> 00:11:01.360
He also said you could understand him

126
00:11:06.052 --> 00:11:07.676
You can still laugh

127
00:11:08.564 --> 00:11:10.096
are you stupid

128
00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:20.616
We just use different methods

129
00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.844
ways to love each other

130
00:11:27.044 --> 00:11:28.172
that moment

131
00:11:28.992 --> 00:11:30.668
I was shocked

132
00:11:32.248 --> 00:11:33.908
A photo in front of me

133
00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.872
Originally it always looked so small

134
00:11:35.872 --> 00:11:37.144
Very distressing

135
00:11:37.452 --> 00:11:39.160
Very pitiful

136
00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:44.016
But the person who became small is actually me

137
00:11:47.588 --> 00:11:49.612
Zhengyin, that doesn’t work

138
00:11:54.924 --> 00:11:56.836
I can understand Zhengyin

139
00:11:58.864 --> 00:12:01.320
Wasn't his father suddenly taken away from him?

140
00:12:02.724 --> 00:12:05.152
Of course he might hate me

141
00:12:06.712 --> 00:12:09.308
Yi Zhao knows how to apologize

142
00:12:09.308 --> 00:12:12.060
Also willing to be hated

143
00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.400
I just want to...

144
00:12:15.012 --> 00:12:18.056
Give him the love I got

145
00:12:19.216 --> 00:12:20.448
Zhenghan

146
00:12:22.364 --> 00:12:24.596
Love has no reason

147
00:12:25.896 --> 00:12:27.268
No cost

148
00:12:29.304 --> 00:12:31.120
At least my love is like that

149
00:12:33.996 --> 00:12:36.088
He knows how to love

150
00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.584
Also know how to be loved

151
00:12:39.368 --> 00:12:41.192
always love openly

152
00:12:42.176 --> 00:12:43.864
love sincerely

153
00:12:45.692 --> 00:12:46.916
That's it

154
00:12:47.636 --> 00:12:50.856
I dare not say easily that I know Yizhao very well

155
00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.660
A photo in front of me

156
00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:59.384
His mere presence makes people feel extremely oppressive

157
00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:06.960
It’s pure, shiny, and beautiful

158
00:13:08.744 --> 00:13:09.848
i love you

159
00:13:13.916 --> 00:13:14.948
i love you too

160
00:13:16.984 --> 00:13:18.156
That's right

161
00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:23.492
Love may also be called awe

162
00:13:31.308 --> 00:13:32.608
But

163
00:13:32.608 --> 00:13:35.740
I don’t want to hear about you from other people in the future.

164
00:13:39.012 --> 00:13:40.700
OK

165
00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:43.132
I will tell you everything in the future

166
00:13:48.312 --> 00:13:49.400
Let’s talk again

167
00:13:50.056 --> 00:13:51.812
Is there anyone else I need to remove?

168
00:13:52.968 --> 00:13:54.148
Ah…

169
00:13:54.816 --> 00:13:56.256
your exes

170
00:13:58.084 --> 00:14:00.576
I don't like murderers very much...

171
00:14:01.464 --> 00:14:03.792
What would you do if I turned into a murderer?

172
00:14:04.228 --> 00:14:05.836
Leave me behind and walk away alone?

173
00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:10.824
Let's wander around the world for the rest of our lives

174
00:14:14.992 --> 00:14:15.900
Alas

175
00:14:17.316 --> 00:14:19.104
Don't look at me like that

176
00:14:19.104 --> 00:14:20.368
why

177
00:14:22.656 --> 00:14:24.492
Because I want to kiss you

178
00:14:24.492 --> 00:14:25.964
Just kiss me

179
00:14:27.108 --> 00:14:28.528
No

180
00:14:29.576 --> 00:14:30.856
My cold will be passed on to you

181
00:14:35.076 --> 00:14:36.220
No

182
00:14:36.712 --> 00:14:39.208
I've never been infected with a cold in my life

183
00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:44.016
Don't do this. It's really contagious.

184
00:14:44.016 --> 00:14:46.056
You really don’t listen to me

185
00:14:46.056 --> 00:14:47.172
Not listening so quickly

186
00:14:47.172 --> 00:14:48.224
I said it's contagious

187
00:14:49.096 --> 00:14:50.408
No

188
00:14:50.684 --> 00:14:52.836
No... I just told you no

189
00:14:53.324 --> 00:14:54.468
Hello

190
00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:13.420
OK

191
00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.010
-Yizhao -Yeah

192
00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:37.930
Get up and drink the porridge before taking medicine.

193
00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.600
Why is Porridge angry?

194
00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:05.060
I told you clearly that it’s contagious. Please don’t kiss me.

195
00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:10.460
Hello

196
00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:11.690
How

197
00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:14.760
I've never had a cold in my life

198
00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.030
Hate…

199
00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:25.700
Come and open your mouth

200
00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:31.710
How is it

201
00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.810
Delicious

202
00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:37.100
Really?

203
00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:42.940
Oh

204
00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.740
Come

205
00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.120
I will be the one to cook from now on

206
00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:54.670
'Later'?

207
00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:57.060
Yeah

208
00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.350
One photo

209
00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:04.830
Let’s not care about other people’s eyes from now on
If you want to do something, just do it.

210
00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:09.920
Want to do something?

211
00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:14.420
Well, whatever you want, I will do it for you

212
00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:21.690
What's wrong

213
00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.470
what is

214
00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:25.350
Tell me about it

215
00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:27.640
Will I buy you a house?

216
00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:28.830
I'd rather buy you a car

217
00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:32.640
I want to get my high school diploma

218
00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:37.260
Still want to go to college

219
00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:42.330
I want to find something I'm good at

220
00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:46.900
Just do it all

221
00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:51.540
If I'm going to do this I need time and money

222
00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:55.550
Do you think I can’t even give you this investment?

223
00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:02.650
I need a long, long time

224
00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.650
i know

225
00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:08.860
It takes four years to go to college

226
00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:14.210
If I want to find out what I'm good at

227
00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:16.100
may take longer

228
00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.040
Does it have to go to this point?

229
00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:22.670
i want to have

230
00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:25.920
I…

231
00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.690
I want to own your future

232
00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.170
i know

233
00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.600
-I'm a little greedy. -Here you go.

234
00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:41.860
my future

235
00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:44.100
Leave it to you

236
00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:49.250
I knew it would be like this

237
00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:51.490
That's why I didn't say it

238
00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:54.640
How can you just exchange your future with me?

239
00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.360
come here

240
00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:14.920
One photo

241
00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:19.340
I'm not a fuel-efficient lamp

242
00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.690
It means I won’t give everything, only you are the only one

243
00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:35.280
Anyway, what you mean is that you like me too much

244
00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:39.050
You just let me go because you don't want to ruin my future.

245
00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.830
I don't really like it that much...

246
00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:43.500
Hello

247
00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:46.120
The atmosphere is just right now. If you insist...

248
00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:48.240
It hurts. I'm sick. Zhenghan

249
00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.140
-Yeah, I know. -I feel bad.

250
00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:53.100
lie down…

251
00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:04.930
(2 months later)

252
00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:13.560
Thanks

253
00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.470
It seems your dad is very angry

254
00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.160
Stop talking

255
00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:21.130
It was not easy to save my life

256
00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:22.940
look at this bruise

257
00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.250
Can't you be smarter and date him secretly?

258
00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:26.980
Why do you have to be so honest?

259
00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:30.620
I want to be frank

260
00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.350
face one's feelings

261
00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:35.670
You are also a talent

262
00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:38.700
In the end, I defeated your amazing father.

263
00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:41.860
I am the only son in my family

264
00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:44.640
Other relatives are as sick as Xu Zhengyin

265
00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.760
Even my dad wouldn't be able to do it, right?

266
00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:51.580
But I said I would be in charge of overseas branches

267
00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:56.760
Hey, but you don’t care about the consequences no matter what you do.

268
00:20:57.760 --> 00:21:01.350
You're like this and there's nothing anyone can do to you
It just made Yi Zhao Xin very tired.

269
00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:03.180
Didn’t you say you haven’t seen each other for more than a month?

270
00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:07.660
Are you my friend or Yizhao's friend?

271
00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:08.960
Oh, you waste

272
00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:11.470
Hey, I'm a patient

273
00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.940
But what about a photo?

274
00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.200
Won't he set off with you?

275
00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:17.840
Well, we agreed to meet at the airport

276
00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.200
I'm leaving thanks

277
00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:25.340
Zhenghan

278
00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:28.380
What are you doing?

279
00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:31.210
Will he really come?

280
00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:32.840
what

281
00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:35.020
Take a photo

282
00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:37.950
If…

283
00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:40.510
He didn't show up there. What are you going to do?

284
00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:50.730
I'm curious

285
00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:53.270
Such Li Yizhao

286
00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:56.290
Why do you want to leave me?

287
00:21:57.910 --> 00:22:00.400
I have nothing

288
00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:05.620
How come you have nothing?

289
00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.000
You all have me

290
00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:10.140
You have me who has everything

291
00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:11.680
So you have everything

292
00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:14.080
Is that so?

293
00:22:15.840 --> 00:22:16.990
One photo

294
00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:18.540
Yeah

295
00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:23.480
I have something curious

296
00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:27.920
I…

297
00:22:28.520 --> 00:22:31.700
I really decided to leave my future to you.

298
00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:37.690
I want to be your family

299
00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:41.620
Even if there are occasional misunderstandings and quarrels

300
00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:44.720
let each other get hurt

301
00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:48.750
I also want to be that kind of person with you who won’t have conflicts because of these

302
00:22:49.230 --> 00:22:50.860
and severed relationship

303
00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:55.720
So you...

304
00:22:57.680 --> 00:22:59.060
are you ready

305
00:23:12.350 --> 00:23:15.600
(One photo, I’m leaving)

306
00:24:40.980 --> 00:24:42.290
It's a photo

307
00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:45.720
The sound of footsteps running towards me

308
00:24:47.160 --> 00:24:50.610
Even if it's a faint sound coming from afar

309
00:24:50.610 --> 00:24:51.980
Just a photo

310
00:24:52.510 --> 00:24:54.460
I'll definitely recognize it

311
00:24:59.940 --> 00:25:02.070
One photo, are you ready?

312
00:25:02.070 --> 00:25:03.460
I'm ready

313
00:25:03.460 --> 00:25:04.930
Where's uncle's house?

314
00:25:04.930 --> 00:25:06.340
It doesn't matter

315
00:25:06.340 --> 00:25:08.560
Now I have something I want to protect more.

316
00:25:08.560 --> 00:25:10.460
Is there something you want to protect?

317
00:25:10.460 --> 00:25:13.280
you and me

318
00:25:13.280 --> 00:25:15.160
all belong to you

319
00:25:15.160 --> 00:25:18.090
my future my present

320
00:25:18.350 --> 00:25:19.750
And my past

321
00:25:20.890 --> 00:25:22.160
And I

322
00:25:22.570 --> 00:25:26.010
I caught the weight of the future that rushed into my arms with all its strength.

323
00:25:26.010 --> 00:25:28.540
caught you

324
00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:37.760
when will it arrive

325
00:25:37.760 --> 00:25:38.960
It's hot, right?

326
00:25:39.540 --> 00:25:41.750
Just another five minutes or so of walking…

327
00:25:41.750 --> 00:25:43.620
You just said it was five minutes

328
00:25:44.970 --> 00:25:47.440
How do you manage to live in a rural place like this?

329
00:25:49.080 --> 00:25:50.990
Oh what are you doing?

330
00:25:51.770 --> 00:25:53.250
It looks like it's going to rain

331
00:25:53.250 --> 00:25:54.640
Will it rain suddenly?

332
00:25:55.750 --> 00:25:57.180
This is how it is here

333
00:25:57.180 --> 00:25:59.440
It rained suddenly and stopped suddenly

334
00:26:00.340 --> 00:26:02.330
Hey, go there and run.

335
00:26:22.830 --> 00:26:25.100
It would be better if you didn't go back to Seoul

336
00:26:25.310 --> 00:26:27.560
Hey, don't say such scary things

337
00:26:30.840 --> 00:26:32.550
Let's wait until the rain stops before leaving.

338
00:26:37.490 --> 00:26:39.590
I want to play with you forever

339
00:26:41.220 --> 00:26:42.410
or

340
00:26:43.300 --> 00:26:45.490
I hope you can come over during your holidays

341
00:27:03.460 --> 00:27:04.640
Li Yizhao

342
00:27:08.060 --> 00:27:09.480
Wouldn't it be nice if you came over?

343
00:27:11.640 --> 00:27:13.430
Why do you always ask me to come?

344
00:27:14.400 --> 00:27:15.530
Come here yourself

